{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218070","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521807001:0":{"text":"물안개 영지는 우리 아쿠보르의 땅이다. 이곳의 풀 한 포기, 나무 한 그루까지 모두 아쿠보르의 것이니, 먼지 한 톨도 훔쳐 갈 생각 마라!","source_cn":"水泽营地是雅库伯尔的领地，里面一草一木都属于雅库伯尔！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD064372F85F4FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521807002:0":{"text":"그건 <style=\"highlight\">우리가 남겨둔 물건이다</style>!","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>我们留下的东西<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA649B69005BA33EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521807003:1":{"text":"다들 입 다물어라!","source_cn":"都闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDEA30A832FA5FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521807004:0":{"text":"너, 보칼리스의 영주. 여기는 무슨 일이지?","source_cn":"你，呼临的领主。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FA75F858897EE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521807005:0":{"text":"우리 병사가 이전에... 음, 물안개 영지에 머물 때 두고 간 물건들이 있어서요. 그걸 찾으러 온 것뿐이에요.","source_cn":"我的士兵们之前……唔，待在水泽营地的时候，遗留了一些东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162AA23321960C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521807006:0":{"text":"헛소리! 분명 물건을 훔치려는 거겠지!","source_cn":"胡扯！你们分明是想偷东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B61794267E542A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521807007:0":{"text":"아니요! 남겨둔 물건은 대부분 아쿠보르는 쓰지도 않는 갑옷이었어요.","source_cn":"才不是！遗留下来的东西大多是盔甲，雅库伯尔从来都没用过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48FAC15351BD5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521807008:0":{"text":"별거 아닌 물건이라 돌려주지 않아도 괜찮지만... 그 중에 <style=\"highlight\">페르세우스가 쓰던 방패</style>가 있어서, 그건 꼭 돌려받아야 해요!","source_cn":"一些无关紧要的东西，不还也没关系……但是其中还有<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EB025E16C27A33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521807009:0":{"text":"아쿠보르의 수장. 그 물건들을 보칼리스에게 돌려줘요.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔的首领，请你让他们把这些东西还给呼临。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF5742494EE96C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521807010:0":{"text":"페르세우스? 아쿠보르에 수많은 고통을 안겨준 자 아닌가.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，哼。他让雅库伯尔吃过很多苦头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A2B3F24158B958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521807011:0":{"text":"하지만 강한 전사였다.","source_cn":"但他很强，是个不错的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D2881AB990815E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521807012:0":{"text":"제카, 물건은 어디 있지?","source_cn":"泽卡，东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59C745CC84DC1637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521807013:0":{"text":"전쟁에서 진 건 보칼리스입니다. 물건의 처분은 아쿠보르가 결정할 일이에요!","source_cn":"战败的是呼临，那些东西就应该随雅库伯尔处置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x839ED491840FAF0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521807014:0":{"text":"마지막으로 묻는다. 물건은 어디 있지?","source_cn":"我再问一遍。东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC62D69B7A9A2F565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521807015:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521807016:0":{"text":"보... 보칼리스인의 물건은 전부 <style=\"highlight\">영지 밖에 버렸습니다</style>. <style=\"highlight\">북쪽</style>에요.","source_cn":"我……我把呼临人的东西都<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB886A17761B68F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521807017:0":{"text":"가... 감히 페르세우스의 물건을 함부로 버리다니!","source_cn":"你——你怎么能随意丢弃珀尔修斯的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DF771BC0FA6EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521807018:0":{"text":"됐어... 그냥 지금 가져가면 되니까.","source_cn":"算了……我现在就去把它拿回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB46F5B6DAAD12E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521807019:0":{"text":"휴전 협정을 체결해야 그곳에 갈 수 있다.","source_cn":"签完停战合约，你才可以去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B275162EAABFD52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521807020:0":{"text":"...아, 안 돼요. 페르세우스의 유물 먼저 찾아야 해요.","source_cn":"……不，不行。我必须先拿到珀尔修斯的遗物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57589938BBCCC270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521807021:0":{"text":"페르세우스는 보칼리스의 영웅이에요. 그러니 페르세우스의 물건을 모두 함께 묻어야 하는데...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯是呼临的英雄，我必须要让他的每样东西，都陪伴他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCD